<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="#">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><a href="/markets/medical">Medical</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Wireless Charging</span></div></div><div class="mk-spoke-grid"><aside class="mk-side"><div class="side-head"><span class="side-head-label">Medical products</span><button type="button" class="mk-side-toggle" aria-label="Collapse sidebar"><span class="chev"><i data-lucide="chevron-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></span></button></div><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/hearing-aid-assembly"><span class="abbr">HA</span><span class="label">Hearing Aid Assembly</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/mems-sensors"><span class="abbr">MS</span><span class="label">Medical MEMS &amp; Sensors</span></a><a class="s" href="/markets/medical/pcba"><span class="abbr">PB</span><span class="label">Medical PCBA</span></a><a class="s active" href="/markets/medical/wireless-charging"><span class="abbr">WC</span><span class="label">Wireless Charging</span></a><div class="helper"><div class="h">Not sure which fits?</div><p>Tell us what the device does and the regulatory route it follows and we&rsquo;ll point you to the right line.</p><a class="cta" href="/contact">Work with us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></aside><div class="mk-spoke-main"><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><div class="mk-eyebrow">Medical &middot; Wireless Charging</div><h1 class="mk-h1">Wireless charging for medical devices</h1><p class="mk-lede">Where a medical device is sealed, the charging interface moves outside it — into a coil, a charging case or a charging module built as its own assembly. Hana assembles both halves of that pairing: coil winding and coil assembly, the board behind it, and box build through to a finished, functionally tested unit.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#specialize-wireless-charging" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">What we specialize in</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><div class="mk-ph" style="aspect-ratio:auto;height:420px;border-bottom:0;"><div style="position:absolute;top:10px;left:12px;width:18px;height:18px;opacity:.4;z-index:1;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--hana-blue)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 3v4M12 17v4M3 12h4M17 12h4"></path></svg></div><span class="cap">[ Wireless Charging &mdash; photography needed ]</span></div></div></div></section><section id="specialize-wireless-charging" data-hana-bg="hex" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:26px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">What we specialize in</h2><p class="mk-body">For medical programs this most often means hearing-aid charging cases and charging modules for wearable medical devices, assembled alongside the device itself on dedicated medical lines under an ISO 13485 quality system. Coil winding and assembly is a named group capability, so the coil is not handed to a third party.</p></div><div class="mk-sheet"><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">01</span><span class="t">Hearing-aid charging cases</span></div><div class="desc">the charging case assembled alongside the hearing device it serves. See Hearing aid assembly.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">02</span><span class="t">Wearable medical charging modules</span></div><div class="desc">coil, board and enclosure assembled and functionally tested as one unit.</div></div><div class="row"><div class="lab"><span class="n">03</span><span class="t">Coil winding and assembly</span></div><div class="desc">coil work handled in-house as part of the build rather than bought in.</div></div></div><div class="mk-caplinks"><p class="note">Process depth sits on the capability page: PCBA &amp; Box Build owns the small-format board build and the mechanical assembly steps that close a wearable-sized unit around it.</p><div class="links"><a href="/capabilities/pcba-box-build">Explore PCBA &amp; Box Build <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></a></div></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:24px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">Footprint</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where we build</h2></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><div class="note">medical device and charging assembly</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><div class="note">coil assembly and charging PCBA</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div><p style="margin:18px 0 0;"><a href="/locations" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;">All locations <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i></a></p></div></section><section style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><div class="mk-eyebrow">FAQ</div><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Why does wireless charging matter for medical devices?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">When a device is sealed, there is no charging connector to build into the enclosure, so the charging interface becomes a separate assembly — a case or module with its own coil, board and test. Hana builds that assembly alongside the device. For the broader wireless-charging picture, see <a href="/markets/consumer/wireless-charging">Consumer Electronics</a>.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana integrate charging into a sealed device?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Coil winding and assembly, board assembly and box build all run inside Hana, so the coil and the device can be assembled and tested within one company rather than across suppliers.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What quality system covers medical charging assemblies?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">This work runs on dedicated medical lines under an ISO 13485 quality system, with the same documentation, change control and traceability discipline applied to the charging assembly as to the device.</p></details></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><a href="/markets/medical" class="hana-link" style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;"><i data-lucide="arrow-left" style="width:13px;height:13px;"></i> Back to the Medical market hub</a></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Talk to us about your medical charging program</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what you need built and we will come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section></div></div>
